 temps en temps ! :)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":329,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1785110400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":6.976744186046512,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":329}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"S60_600_1","description":"Séance de seuil 60' où tu vas enchaîner **6 répétitions de 3'** à l'allure cible entrecoupées de 1'30 de footing lent pour récupérer.","displayName":"Seuil 60","coachAdvice":"On attaque le seuil 60 aujourd'hui, l'allure que tu serais capable de tenir pendant 60 minutes au total si tu étais 100% reposé(e) et en fin de préparation. On n'en est pas encore là, mais on va t'y emmener progressivement. Profite bien de ce nouveau cycle d'entraînement, moins tu manqueras de séances de seuil, plus tu pourras profiter des bénéfices exceptionnels de ce cycle !","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_15","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":329,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":6,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"S60_3","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 60","value":255,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"seuil60"},"durations":[{"value":3,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_1.5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","